WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.487
Yikes!

2
00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:06.182
Who

3
00:00:06.183 --> 00:00:09.486
are you? I'm

4
00:00:09.486 --> 00:00:12.516
a hammerhead shark. Hammerhead

5
00:00:12.516 --> 00:00:16.495
sharks are big fish. Where

6
00:00:16.495 --> 00:00:19.568
do you live? Hammerhead

7
00:00:19.568 --> 00:00:23.603
sharks live in the ocean. We

8
00:00:23.603 --> 00:00:27.993
swim in deep water. And

9
00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:32.616
sometimes we swim close to land. Your

10
00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:35.885
head looks cool! Our

11
00:00:35.885 --> 00:00:39.474
eyes are wide apart. They

12
00:00:39.475 --> 00:00:42.495
help us see well. We're

13
00:00:42.496 --> 00:00:47.049
good at finding stingrays! Are

14
00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:51.149
stingrays your favorite food? Yes.

15
00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:55.514
But we eat other ocean animals too. We

16
00:00:55.514 --> 00:01:00.682
like fish, crabs, and squid.

17
00:01:00.683 --> 00:01:03.511
Do sharks lay eggs?

18
00:01:03.511 --> 00:01:06.219
Some sharks lay eggs.

19
00:01:06.219 --> 00:01:10.237
But hammerhead eggs hatch inside the mother.

20
00:01:10.238 --> 00:01:16.308
Babies are born about one year later.

21
00:01:16.308 --> 00:01:20.516
You have sharp teeth!

22
00:01:20.516 --> 00:01:24.626
We have lots of teeth.

23
00:01:24.627 --> 00:01:30.276
We use them for eating prey.

24
00:01:30.276 --> 00:01:32.966
Do you have any enemies?

25
00:01:32.966 --> 00:01:35.898
Animals don't hunt us.

26
00:01:35.898 --> 00:01:39.824
But some people hunt us for our fins.

27
00:01:39.824 --> 00:01:48.162
And sometimes we get caught in fishing nets.

28
00:01:48.162 --> 00:01:50.194
There's a stingray.

29
00:01:50.195 --> 00:01:53.435
It's time to hunt!

30
00:01:53.435 --> 00:01:58.573
Good-bye, Hammerhead Shark!

